Generic single-database configuration with async SQLAlchemy.

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the E-commerce Backend API.

## Usage

Generate a new migration:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Description of changes"

Run migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

Rollback one migration:
    alembic downgrade -1

View current revision:
    alembic current

View migration history:
    alembic history
